  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>Savour more moments</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">ETO makes any bottle of wine taste better for longer. So you can savour every scent, sound, and sip, with the people you love.</p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>Beautiful, by design</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Crafted over five years and across 60 prototypes, the ETO decanter isn't just beautifully designed – its unique sealing mechanism protects wine from oxidation for up to two weeks. With ETO, the last glass always tastes just as good as the first.</p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>Your wine, your way</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">ETO is available in six metallic finishes, which can each be personalised with a unique message. And because ETO preserves wines of any colour, it's the perfect gift for every wine-lover, whatever their taste. Or, even, wine-lovers: buy more than one ETO and save up to £20.</p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>Richard Hemming, Master of Wine</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">\"There was no perceptible difference between a freshly opened bottle and the ETO-stored sample…a simple and elegant solution.\"</p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>Waste not</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Wine, like life, is a precious thing. With ETO, you'll savour every drop.</p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>Using ETO&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><em>Decant -&nbsp;</em>Decant your bottle into ETO to open-up the wine and release its full flavour.</p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><em>Serve -&nbsp;</em>ETO’s long funnel oxygenates the wine, and it’s sharp pouring lip prevents drips.</p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><em>Preserve</em> - ETO’s patented design creates an airtight seal between the wine and air, preserving the wine’s flavour for up to two weeks.</p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>Affiliate Terms</strong></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">The baseline commission rate for the ETO Affiliate Program is 3% on approved sales. This rate applies to all affiliates upon joining the program.</li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">30-day cookie window</li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">We are open to offering increased commission rates based on your performance, including factors such as volume of sales generated, the quality of traffic, and alignment with our brand values.</li><li style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Payment will be on the first Tuesday of each month, 60 days after the order has been fulfilled and shipped.</li><li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt 0px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">View our guide for full terms and conditions.</li></ul></div>",
